Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love him!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.38,0:00:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with Senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.58,0:00:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been in love with him since the day we met,\Nfor the past ten years.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.17,0:00:33.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're in love with...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.83,0:00:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.33,0:00:40.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I assumed you hadn't noticed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.17,0:00:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I've been spending so much time with Senpai...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.71,0:00:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I should've known...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.04,0:00:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the worst thing I could've done.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.17,0:01:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why did I tell her?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.58,0:01:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew if I told her the truth,\Nshe'd change the way she acts.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And if that happens,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.42,0:01:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,there's no way I'll ever make\Nthings work with Senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.88,0:01:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've ruined everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get to go to Summer Comiket\Nwith friends in a group cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.96,0:01:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. I'll stop spending so much-
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.50,0:01:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.58,0:01:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.67,0:01:30.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just pretend I didn't say anything.\NI don't like him.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.58,0:01:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I made it all up, okay?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.58,0:01:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.21,0:01:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai taught me that real otaku never\Njudge someone by the things they love.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.29,0:01:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pretend I didn't say anything.\NJust tell me more about how you feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.00,0:01:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,And why should I tell you?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I want to know more about you!\NAbout why you love him.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.13,0:02:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess I like how the shape of\Nhis eyes makes him look mean.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.71,0:02:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I like that he's tall,\Nbut I liked him when he was short, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.17,0:02:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I like how round the back of his head is.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.38,0:02:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I like how he looks straight into your eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.04,0:02:22.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,How he'll risk everything to help someone else.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.04,0:02:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai will give his whole heart to others,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.04,0:02:32.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,but he'll never notice when\Nother people do the same for him.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like he's intentionally blocking it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.46,0:02:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's stuck where he was when he\Nstopped trusting women as a kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.08,0:02:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was the same way when I met him.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.25,0:02:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.21,0:02:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure do know a lot about him, Mikari-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.04,0:02:52.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I've been watching him for ten years.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.00,0:02:53.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because you love him a whole lot!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.83,0:02:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wasn't doing it because I loved him.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.17,0:03:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was looking for reasons to hate him,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.96,0:03:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I could finally forget him.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.88,0:03:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Loving him hurts, you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to deny it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.33,0:03:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,A few good memories shouldn't\Nmake up for how crappy he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.42,0:03:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to forget him so badly that
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.50,0:03:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I started making a whole\Nlist of reasons to hate him.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.08,0:03:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that list came up empty?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.29,0:03:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please. Just the opposite.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.63,0:03:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I came up with tons of reasons.\NMy list was so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.58,0:03:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's a weirdo otaku, totally emotionally stunted...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.63,0:03:38.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even when I thought I'd found them all,\Nhe still gave me reasons to hate him!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.75,0:03:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, even knowing all that,\NI still couldn't stop loving him.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.92,0:03:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even deny it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Heartbreaking, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.46,0:03:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Loving someone can break your heart?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.79,0:04:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your turn now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.08,0:04:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I asked you this before. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love Senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.63,0:04:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't even hesitate.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.08,0:04:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's the same way you feel, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.58,0:04:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I understand why you like him so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.75,0:04:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's so great!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.13,0:04:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love his mean eyes,\Nhis height, the back of his head, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.21,0:04:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna gush about all the things\NI like about him, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.38,0:04:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's not some manga\Ncharacter you can fangirl over.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't see the difference!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.25,0:04:42.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Person or manga character, animals,\Ntrains, whatever, the love is all the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.54,0:04:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,then Senpai's love for Liliel wouldn't be real,\Nwhen I know it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.92,0:04:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai is a good person.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be there for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.00,0:04:58.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there, rooting for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.83,0:05:03.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai came into my life and made it better.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.67,0:05:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a cosplayer.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.92,0:05:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,My life as a cosplayer doesn't\Nexist without Senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.92,0:05:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't exist without him.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.71,0:05:22.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's how much he means to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.46,0:05:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know if that means I'm in love with him,\Nbut I know that I love him.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.38,0:05:34.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what do you think?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.08,0:05:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure do love him a lot.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.08,0:05:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Weirdly, I'm happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.33,0:05:59.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're Senpai otaku!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't go there.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.13,0:06:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've gotta gush more about him together!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.71,0:06:05.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.17,0:06:12.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I never wanted to get rid of my rivals.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.29,0:06:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just wanted a friend\NI could open up to about my feelings.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.46,0:06:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,And Ririsa...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.08,0:06:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,...is my friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.75,0:06:33.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.04,0:06:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you ever decide you want to date Senpai,\Ndon't worry about me.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.08,0:06:43.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.75,0:06:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay. Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.83,0:07:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari is in love with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,How the hell did I not notice?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.46,0:07:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.71,0:07:12.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be different from how Ririsa feels.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She loves me like I love Liliel,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.13,0:07:17.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,like I used to like other girls...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.13,0:07:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how this is gonna go from here...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what if she asks me out?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.00,0:07:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What if she asks me to be her boyfriend?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.46,0:07:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd have to say no, because I don't...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.83,0:07:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't like her like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.08,0:07:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.54,0:07:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why would I have to do\Nsomething that horrible to her?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.33,0:07:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could ask to stay friends,\Nbut how would that work?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.75,0:07:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be awkward?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.79,0:08:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari might stop coming to club.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.88,0:08:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just quit, then?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.29,0:08:06.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, that wouldn't make anyone happy!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.75,0:08:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What should I...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.25,0:08:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.21,0:08:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wanna talk about this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What should I even do?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.96,0:08:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dunno if I can tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.54,0:08:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It depends on how Mikari feels,\Nwhat she does, and how you feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are you scared of?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The fact that you'll have to reject\Nher if she asks you out?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.83,0:08:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or the fact that doing that would ruin\Nyour relationship with Mikari and the club?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.25,0:08:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It could be both.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.17,0:08:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I dunno.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.50,0:09:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never imagined what I'd do in this kind of situation.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.38,0:09:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What would you do, Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.54,0:09:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.29,0:09:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have you ever been in love?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.17,0:09:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think of me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.13,0:09:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never had a love life, being a huge otaku.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.71,0:09:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I thought about it a whole lot.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.29,0:09:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Before, I thought it was stupid to go on dates,\Nor to keep asking someone out.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.54,0:09:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, I thought life was like a dating sim,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.88,0:09:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,where the more you talk to someone,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.71,0:09:39.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,the more you level up their relationship,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,until asking them out finally works.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.13,0:09:43.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And if that didn't work,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.38,0:09:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,then they were never an option in the first place.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.38,0:09:44.46,Q4,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.46,0:09:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,then they were never an option in the first place.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.75,0:09:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, in manga and anime,\Nall the couples are already in love with each other,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.13,0:09:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the big confession scene is like a magic\Nspell that makes them realize it's mutual.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.17,0:10:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.38,0:10:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The problem, though,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.04,0:10:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,is it convinces you it's not worth dating\Nsomeone unless they're "The One."
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.17,0:10:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, that's not how it works in real life.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.71,0:10:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some people start dating someone even though\Nthey might not feel anything towards them.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.75,0:10:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some people think, "if you're gonna keep asking me out,\NI might as well give you a chance."
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.33,0:10:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, let me figure out what I'm trying to say.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.58,0:10:30.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay to start dating someone even if\Nyou don't like them that way just yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.33,0:10:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Getting asked out might be the first time\Nyou realize someone likes you that way.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.25,0:10:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's when you ask yourself how you feel about them.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.75,0:10:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like wow, I can be myself around them,\Nor I'm always stealing glances at them.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I miss them when they're gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.75,0:10:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe that means I like them?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.79,0:10:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You might start finding new things about\Nthem that make you start to feel differently.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.29,0:10:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Love is complicated.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.88,0:11:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You might find "The One."\NYou might suddenly realize you're in love.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.21,0:11:05.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or, you might start falling for\Nsomeone after you start dating.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.96,0:11:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actively searching for reasons to fall\Nin love someone is totally valid, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.08,0:11:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry if that didn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you at least see my point?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.33,0:11:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have to end my friendship with Mikari
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.17,0:11:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,just because I don't\Nlike her that way right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I know how she feels,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.88,0:11:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might see her differently,\Nand start feeling differently, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, A+ for listening comprehension.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.42,0:11:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I will.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.08,0:11:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't felt that way about\Na girl for a really long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.00,0:11:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might not know why you\Ndon't feel anything for real girls,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.83,0:11:48.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,or what might've happened in\Nyour past to make you feel that way.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.54,0:11:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I know you've had a lot\Nof new experiences this year.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.83,0:11:57.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you've spent a lot of them with\Nthe girls you've always wanted to avoid.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.25,0:12:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about the 3D world now?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.38,0:12:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know there are parts of reality that really suck,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.38,0:12:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,but there are some parts worth living for.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.58,0:12:16.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you which parts those are, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.08,0:12:19.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, is it still impossible for you to trust women?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.83,0:12:20.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.00,0:12:27.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're good at creating close\Nrelationships with other people.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.00,0:12:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not afraid to risk everything\Nto help someone you care about.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.08,0:12:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it's okay to let people help you, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.42,0:12:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid to let people in.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.71,0:12:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Relationships are a two-way street.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.79,0:12:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It takes two people to make something meaningful.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.25,0:12:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That make sense?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.96,0:12:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It takes two...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.96,0:12:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,In my opinion,\Nthere's one thing you get wrong about Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.25,0:12:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.75,0:12:59.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel isn't loyal because she's an angel.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.04,0:13:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's loyal because she wants to be, for Ashford.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.54,0:13:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not,\Nsomeone could feel that way about you, Okumura.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.00,0:13:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone would feel that way about me?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.42,0:13:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The same way Liliel feels about Ashford?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.54,0:13:24.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.54,0:13:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that's why I never caught onto Mikari's feelings.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.67,0:13:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I never saw myself as a character in my world.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.88,0:13:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I only see everyone else.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.54,0:13:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never asked myself\Nwhat they might think about me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.04,0:13:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mom... Was that a lie?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.42,0:13:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to feel betrayed again.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.79,0:14:01.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so terrified of going through that again,\NI ignored all the signs that people cared about me.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.96,0:14:05.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,When in reality, I... I've been...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.79,0:14:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me ask again.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.33,0:14:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it still impossible for you to trust women?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.67,0:14:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.46,0:14:20.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay if you still only trust your 2D Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, there's a difference between\Nnot seeing and choosing not to see.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.17,0:14:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can open your eyes, Okumura.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.00,0:14:34.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Angels exist in the 3D world, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.00,0:14:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feel a little better after that?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.75,0:14:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.21,0:14:52.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I still don't know what I'll do about Mikari.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.63,0:14:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's okay.\NWhat now? Want to just leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.63,0:14:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way! We have to finish our training arc!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.08,0:15:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right! I finally understand why\NI liked those moments so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.92,0:15:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've only ever seen them as\Nsubjects through the camera.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.42,0:15:16.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never thought about how\Nthey might be looking at me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't figure it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.67,0:15:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,They smiled or frowned\Nbecause they were looking at me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.83,0:15:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was all because of me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.54,0:15:33.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm the only person\Nwho can get those photos!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.04,0:15:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks like you made a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.50,0:15:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think I can bust down that mental wall now.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.46,0:15:42.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to open my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.13,0:15:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want to reject Mikari without\Nseeing her for who she really is.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.42,0:15:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can do that if I break down that wall.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.25,0:15:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not just doing this for Ririsa's dream.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.58,0:15:57.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this for Mikari, and myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.88,0:16:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving until I see this through to the end!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.83,0:16:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, girls, Okumura's up!\NLet's get back to work!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.92,0:16:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's up?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.17,0:16:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin won't come out from under her blanket.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.50,0:16:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.88,0:16:19.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Crying ruined my makeup\Nand made my eyes all puffy!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.75,0:16:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't let him see me like this!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.42,0:16:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.29,0:16:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forget about me and go finish the shoot!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.96,0:16:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna get in the way of you and Senpai\Nmaking your lovey-dovey cosrom, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.04,0:16:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.63,0:16:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.17,0:16:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,How's Mikari?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.63,0:16:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai?! W-what is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.83,0:16:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope I get to take pictures of you again soon!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.71,0:17:01.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.58,0:17:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.54,0:17:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to try something new.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.17,0:17:09.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I realized it's not the camera\Nsettings that make a good photo,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.96,0:17:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's the timing of when I take it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.29,0:17:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always try to pick the moment where\NI feel you look just like the real Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.29,0:17:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, then I thought how your Liliel was
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.25,0:17:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,different from Xiaoyu's,\Nnot in a bad way, just different.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.71,0:17:30.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the 3D person that brings the 2D Liliel to life.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.75,0:17:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need you to see our 2.5D angel.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.75,0:17:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,So now, I want to try to capture your specific Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.83,0:17:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's my plan for today.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.83,0:17:42.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,My specific Liliel...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.46,0:17:48.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking the same thing!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.79,0:17:52.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter how badly I might want\Nto transform into Liliel,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.46,0:17:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't erase myself completely.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.88,0:18:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought the perfect cosplay was one where\Nyou couldn't see the cosplayer beneath it,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.71,0:18:02.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,but now, it's time to try something different.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.21,0:18:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to exist in the same space as Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could we sit this one out and just watch?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.42,0:18:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.13,0:18:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is way too advanced for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.88,0:18:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The whole reason we're here is\Nto help with your cosrom.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.50,0:18:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's easier to do solo pics, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.17,0:18:25.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, I want to see how they come out!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.13,0:18:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Just focus on Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready, Liliel?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.29,0:18:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm ready!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.25,0:18:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes! Do this for Mikari! For Ririsa!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.33,0:18:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,For everyone who cares about me!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.13,0:18:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not recreating the source.\NI'm creating my own Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.71,0:18:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What aspects do we both share?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.25,0:18:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,How does she feel? How do I feel?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.71,0:19:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama, I love you!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.92,0:19:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't! I have to keep these feelings to myself!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.04,0:19:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai promised he wouldn't fall for\Nme so we could be cosplay partners.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.58,0:19:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be fair for me to fall for him.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.38,0:19:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's the same way you feel, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.75,0:19:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was a lie.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.63,0:19:24.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought I was telling Mikari-chan the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.96,0:19:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't like him as just a friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I lied to myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.13,0:19:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I already know how I feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's more than that.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.04,0:19:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.29,0:19:42.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai will never feel anything for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.29,0:19:42.00,Q8,,0,0,0,,Wear all the sexy outfits you want,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.00,0:19:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai will never feel anything for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.00,0:19:44.46,Q8,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you I won't feel a thing for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.96,0:19:49.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll never have him. That's why this is okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.25,0:19:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why, right now,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.54,0:19:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can let out some of the feelings\NI've been holding back for so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.21,0:20:03.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama, I love you!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.92,0:20:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.13,0:20:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need to see the Ririsa inside Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.92,0:20:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.58,0:20:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't believe summer break's almost over.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.00,0:20:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's all take a picture together!\NCan I post this one online?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.13,0:20:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No thanks.\NI'm scared of your side of social media.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.42,0:20:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,My contract says I can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.63,0:20:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not if we're not cosplaying...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.42,0:20:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure you guys are teenagers?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.25,0:20:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.29,0:20:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay! Lemme get one with you!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.42,0:20:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never mind. People might think we're dating.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.04,0:20:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.00,0:20:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want a picture with you, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, I thought you just said you can't!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.42,0:20:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. She wants to take a picture with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.33,0:20:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's kinda cute.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.71,0:21:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what did I just think?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.67,0:21:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,How'd your training arc turn out?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.33,0:21:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think I know what you mean now\Nabout relationships being a two-way street.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.29,0:21:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I lived my whole life assuming no\None had cared about me at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.75,0:21:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, now I know people do care.\NThey have thoughts and opinions about me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.17,0:21:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,So of course they have feelings about me, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the first time I've ever realized...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.83,0:21:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I actually exist as something in other people's lives.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.71,0:21:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.79,0:21:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess going from nothing to\Nsomething is progress, but still...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.58,0:21:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,When's he gonna realize that he means
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.58,0:21:46.04,Q8,,0,0,0,,Are you done staring at those pictures yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.04,0:21:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,everything to some of the people around him?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.04,0:21:48.42,Q8,,0,0,0,,Ack, sorry! Here!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.04,0:21:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'know...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.17,0:22:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty good picture.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.04,0:22:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noa! You're going to be late for school!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.25,0:22:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.54,0:22:48.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's walk together!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.08,0:22:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, girls! Always love your energy. Have fun!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.58,0:22:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We will!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.29,0:23:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi, we should all go out to dinner tonight!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.54,0:23:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.33,0:23:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan, Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.33,0:23:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Detention again?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.50,0:23:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the delay, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.63,0:23:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.79,0:23:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ooh, is it ready?!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.17,0:23:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.04,0:23:25.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel: Side Story, Okumura's Cut!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.71,0:23:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You made this?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.21,0:23:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure did! Figured it'd inspire your next project.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.25,0:23:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to watch it!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.88,0:23:40.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.75,0:23:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm doing this, too?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.54,0:23:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready, go!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:52.08,0:23:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
